FN:Fold Test
NOTE:V* folds at seventy-five octets and every continuation line spends one of them on its leading space. This note is long enough to need four physical lines, so a codec that alternates its chunk widths overruns on the second continuation. Padding follows to push the logical line well past three folds. xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
END:VCARD
